      "id": "sec_s2l11_concept",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 2 • LESSON 11</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf 'Anna' (Ke): الْكِتَابُ ← أَنَّ الْكِتَابَ ، أَنَّ اللَّهَ (Page 71)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الْكِتَابُ ، اللَّهُ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Anna (أَنَّ + ـَ)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">أَنَّ الْكِتَابَ ، أَنَّ اللَّهَ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• الْكِتَابُ ، اللَّهُ (Kitaab, Allah (ـُ)) se أَنَّ الْكِتَابَ ، أَنَّ اللَّهَ (Ke Kitaab, Ke beshak Allah (ـَ)) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Huroof-e-Jarr, Inna, Laa, Illaa, Kaana aur Yaa Qur'ani jumlon ki buniyadi chabiyan hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Page 71):** **`أَنَّ`** ka matlab **'ke / ke beshak'** hai (yeh jumle ke darmiyan mein aata hai jabke `إِنَّ` shuru mein aata hai). `إِنَّ` ki tarah `أَنَّ` ke baad aane wale ism par bhi **Zabar (`ـَ`)** aata hai: `أَنَّ اللَّهَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيرٌ` (ke Allah har cheez par qaadir hai).",
        "content": "<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 2 • LESSON 11</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf 'Anna' (Ke): الْكِتَابُ ← أَنَّ الْكِتَابَ ، أَنَّ اللَّهَ (Page 71)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الْكِتَابُ ، اللَّهُ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Anna (أَنَّ + ـَ)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">أَنَّ الْكِتَابَ ، أَنَّ اللَّهَ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• الْكِتَابُ ، اللَّهُ (Kitaab, Allah (ـُ)) se أَنَّ الْكِتَابَ ، أَنَّ اللَّهَ (Ke Kitaab, Ke beshak Allah (ـَ)) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Huroof-e-Jarr, Inna, Laa, Illaa, Kaana aur Yaa Qur'ani jumlon ki buniyadi chabiyan hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Page 71):** **`أَنَّ`** ka matlab **'ke / ke beshak'** hai (yeh jumle ke darmiyan mein aata hai jabke `إِنَّ` shuru mein aata hai). `إِنَّ` ki tarah `أَنَّ` ke baad aane wale ism par bhi **Zabar (`ـَ`)** aata hai: `أَنَّ اللَّهَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيرٌ` (ke Allah har cheez par qaadir hai).",
